  "description": "14 Roebuck Park is a very impressive family home, a four-bedroom terraced house, extending to approx. 138 sq. m. / 1,485 sq. ft., laid out over three levels. Located in an exclusive private development behind electric security gates, set amongst well maintained landscaped communal gardens. \r\n\r\nThe welcoming entrance hallway is airy and flooded with natural light, to the right a guest WC leads off the hallway, to the left is the entrance to the living room, with feature fireplace and double doors which lead into the open plan kitchen / dining room which overlooks the rear garden. The kitchen is fully fitted with various wall and floor units. \r\n\r\nOn the middle floor, there are three bedrooms, two doubles with built in wardrobes, one with ensuite and a large single. A family bathroom completes this level. On the top floor, there is a very generous double bedroom with built in wardrobes and ensuite, windows to the front and to the rear flood the room with natural light. \r\n\r\nThe rear garden is low maintenance laid in patio with raised borders, perfect for an early coffee or alfresco dining. Two car parking spaces are allocated to the front of the property. \r\n\r\nThis outstanding home enjoys an unbeatable location just minutes from Dundrum Town Centre and both Dundrum and Kilmacud LUAS stations. Excellent transport links include the N11, QBC, and easy access to the M50.\r\n\r\nA superb selection of well-established schools is nearby, including: Taney National School, St. Teresa’s Primary, Mount Anville, Wesley College, St. Benildus College, Alexandra College, Gonzaga, Muckross Park, and Blackrock College. UCD Belfield and city-centre colleges are also easily accessible.\n\nEntrance Hall 5.90m x 2.03m\n\nW.C. 1.58m x 0.75m\n\nLiving Room 5.39m x 3.72m\n\nKitchen/ Dining Room 3.82m x 6.03m\n\nFirst Floor Landing 4.35m x 3.65m\n\nBedroom 2 3.77m x 3.39m\n\nEn-Suite 1.66m x 2.04m\n\nBedroom 3 3.65m x 3.44m\n\nBedroom 4 3.93m x 2.59m\n\nBathroom 1.69m x 2.17m\n\nSecond Floor Landing 3.19m x 2.18m\n\nMain Bedroom 6.63m x 3.58m\n\nEn-Suite 1.80m x 2.18m",
